        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "ONC Natural Colors lets you dye your hair while avoiding ammonia and parabens, a big win for pregnant moms. The product’s organic argan and coconut oils work to moisturize your hair without weighing it down or making it look greasy. Reviewers have noted that it provides the same bright color as regular hair dye, and smells like bananas (thanks to banana extract). It’s available in 29 different shades, so you’ll be able to find a close match to your desired hair color.",
