        "text": "If you’re looking to change your hair color to a rich auburn or brassy red, this natural powder — a staple in many South Asian beauty routines — is the way to go. It’s made from pure henna leaves, so it will only make your hair darker. There are no color options — you determine the shade based on the amount you use. You can adjust the ratio of liquid you use in your paste and how long you leave it in your hair to determine how dark you go.",
