        "text": "This ammonia- and paraben- free hair dye contains oleic acid, a fatty acid that’s derived from olives to help soften your hair as it colors. It also features meadowfoam seed oil for extra softness and shine. There are no artificial fragrances, so you won’t be left with a lingering scent. While it’s not the only vegan and cruelty-free option on this list, vegans love this brand for its natural, realistic colors. There are 35 shades to choose from, so you won’t have a hard time finding the right one for you.",
